    "concept_4": {
      "id": "concept_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A power raised to another power repeats the whole power.\n\n(2^3)^4 = 2^(3×4) = 2^12.\n\nSo (a^m)^n = a^(mn).\n\nA common mistake is to add m and n. Here they multiply.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_4"
        }
      ]
    },
